# Testing

Read `.ai/rules/testing.md`. Prefer Pest. Use `actAsTester` / `actAsApplication` / `actAsAdmin` / `getTestFrame()` (forces FrameContext). Run via:

`docker exec olie-api-main php artisan test --compact --filter=X`

If tests cannot run, stop and report.
